  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Env. Strategy Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Milj&#xf6;strategi  Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of 202 000 SEK for the Developing a Strategy for Environment and Sustainable Development for Kosovo. The proposal comes from REC who will be responsible for compiling the strategy together with the Ministry of Environment and Spatial Planning. A draft strategy is already at hand and the Sida support will assist in finalising it. Support for a 2nd step for a Kosovo Env Action Plan is upcoming.</narrative>
  </description>
